  "definition": "Hardship Waiver for Individuals with Substantial Home Equity",
  "effectiveDate": "2017-06-22",
  "historyNote": "#9136, eff 4-22-08; ss by #11058, INTERIM, eff 3-24-16, EXPIRED: 9-20-16 New. #12217, eff 6-22-17 (See Revision Note at Part heading for He-W 821)",
  "inScheme": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/scheme",
